  "notes": "Ditto's Imposter Transforms on switch-in into the Pokemon facing it. It copies the target's CURRENT state: if the target has Mega Evolved, Ditto becomes the Mega forme (and gains that forme's ability); stat stages come along too. HP stays Ditto's own, and every copied move gets 5 PP. Here Gengar has already Mega Evolved and is at +2 Special Attack when Ditto comes in. Note Ditto arrives through a setup send_out rather than a switch: Mega Gengar's Shadow Tag makes a legal switch impossible, which is itself correct.",
